  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Sustained increases in blockade pressure that threaten energy and trade routes prompt governments to activate directed industrial policy (subsidies, mandates, directed investment) to onshore or secure critical tech and energy supply chains, including incentives for domestic compute and chip capacity.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">iran_hormuz_flashpoint</data>
