  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">A spike in maritime incidents elevates national-security concerns and attribution pressure, prompting governments to impose new export controls, investment screening and compliance measures on cross-border AI-relevant technology flows.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
