  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.55</data>
  <data key="d36">Sharp oil-price swings driven by the flashpoint destabilize equity and credit markets and trigger margin calls and liquidity pulls that disproportionately affect highly leveraged AI firms and concentrated platform financiers, increasing correlated financial downside.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">iran_hormuz_flashpoint</data>
  <data key="d39">ai_bio_cyber_disruption</data>
