  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Greater oil‑price volatility raises near‑term inflation and macro uncertainty, leading markets to price in a higher path for short‑term policy rates as central banks are seen likelier to tighten to contain inflation upside.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">iran_hormuz_flashpoint</data>
  <data key="d39">global_currency_market_s</data>
</edge>
