  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Increased drone strikes that damage energy and logistics infrastructure tighten near-term energy supply, lifting inflation expectations and causing markets to push up expected short-term policy rates.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d39">global_currency_market_s</data>
