  <data key="d35">0.55</data>
  <data key="d36">An uptick in armed drone employment and combat-proven tactics in Ukraine accelerates transfers, sales, and tactical adoption by state and proxy actors in the Middle East, increasing the frequency of drone-enabled strikes, near-misses, and harassment of vessels in the Strait of Hormuz.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
