  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">A rising perceived risk of broader escalation gives governments political cover and urgency to tighten export controls, sanctions, vetting, and other national-security–justified restrictions on AI-related trade and finance, increasing regulatory stringency.</data>
