  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.9</data>
  <data key="d36">Higher volumes of committed financing enable data‑centre operators and cloud providers to buy/lease more accelerators and pre‑reserve capacity, directly increasing the compute hours allocated for model training.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_china_tech_trade_riva</data>
