  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">A surge in cross-border capital flows to finance AI infrastructure increases immediate demand for the funding currency (e.g., USD) as purchasers convert into that currency, putting upward pressure on its exchange rate.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_china_tech_trade_riva</data>
  <data key="d39">global_currency_market_s</data>
