  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Targeted subsidies, procurement preferences, and directed investment by states tilt competition toward favored firms and national champions, prompting acquisitions and exits that raise consolidation in AI sectors.</data>
