  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Escalation of state industrial policy (subsidies, export/import measures, directed investment) alters trade balances and creates episodic capital‑flow or exchange‑rate pressure that central banks respond to by increasing FX market interventions to stabilize the currency.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
