  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">Concentration of capital into a small number of platform operators and financiers creates large, correlated balance‑sheet exposures and common counterparties, increasing the likelihood that asset or margin shocks cascade through the financial system.</data>
