  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">An upward revision in expected short-term interest rates tightens debt availability for smaller AI startups and growth firms, increasing distressed exits and acquisition opportunities that accelerate consolidation by large incumbents.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">global_currency_market_s</data>
