  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Rising market-implied short rates increase trade-finance and chartering costs and tighten working-capital for shippers and traders, causing reductions in vessel employment and fewer commercial transits through the Strait of Hormuz over the near term.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">global_currency_market_s</data>
  <data key="d39">iran_hormuz_flashpoint</data>
