  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.9</data>
  <data key="d36">Rising market-implied short‑rate expectations increase the expected cost of short‑term and floating‑rate borrowing, directly raising financing costs for capital‑intensive AI datacenter projects and thereby reducing the volume of committed infrastructure finance.</data>
