  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">Rising long-term sovereign yields increase the cost of capital and lower valuations for cloud/datacenter investment, prompting large cloud providers and enterprises to delay or reduce long-duration compute commitments used for model training.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
