  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Rising long-term sovereign yields increase borrowing and trade-finance costs for shippers and importers and push up insurance and charter rates, reducing shipping demand and the volume of cargo transiting Black Sea and adjacent maritime routes.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
