  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">Higher allocation of compute accelerates development and fine-tuning of autonomous targeting, navigation, and swarm-control models that can be integrated into UAVs, enabling operators to launch more frequent and effective drone strikes in the theatre.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">ai_bio_cyber_disruption</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
