  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Elevated systemic risk from concentrated AI exposures increases exchange‑rate volatility and episodic capital flight, triggering more frequent and larger official FX intervention to stabilize markets.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">ai_bio_cyber_disruption</data>
