  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Spikes in correlated losses or marked exposures tied to AI assets prompt banks and institutional lenders to tighten credit and withdraw or postpone commitments for data‑centre and AI infra projects, cutting financing volumes.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">ai_bio_cyber_disruption</data>
